# Curator of Sun's Creation: "Whenever you discover, discover again for the same value. This ability triggers only once each turn" (CR 701.57a, 603.2).
# Turn 1: Black Lotus and Mox Ruby pay for the Curator and two Moxen for Buried Treasure. Turn 3: Buried Treasure ({5}, exile it) discovers 5: the library has Island,
# a Hit the Mother Lode (mana value 6, over 5, passed over) and Ornithopter, which is found and put into the hand (declined). The Curator triggers and discovers 5 again, the same
# value, so Hit the Mother Lode is passed over again and Chromatic Star (mana value 1, over the 0 a mis-read value would pass) is found. That second discover does not trigger it again (once each turn): Memnite is not
# found, and stays on top of the library.

